# Build context for components/schema-migrator/Dockerfile: the workspace manifests, the
# libraries and providers it may need, and this component. Everything else stays out.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!libs/
!providers/
!components/*/pyproject.toml
!components/schema-migrator/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/tests
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
